    "last_assistant_text": "The PoC triggered the bug successfully. The crash matches exactly:\n- `Heap-use-after-free READ of size 4`\n- Crash in `yr_re_ast_extract_literal` at `re.c:369` (which is the `child = re_ast->root_node->children_tail` followed by `child->type` read)\n- Freed in `yr_re_ast_split_at_chaining_point` at `re.c:514` (the `yr_re_node_destroy(child)` call)\n- DEDUP_TOKEN: `yr_re_ast_extract_literal--_yr_parser_write_string--yr_parser_reduce_string_declaration`\n\nThe PoC `rule t{strings:$a=/a.{,}?/condition:$a}` triggers the heap-use-after-free. The regex `/a.{,}?/` creates a CONCAT with a literal 'a' followed by an ungreedy range-any `.{,}?` (end=32767 > threshold=200). The chaining split destroys the range-any node but leaves `children_tail` pointing to it. When `yr_re_ast_extract_literal` accesses `children_tail`, it reads freed memory.",
